+                      'Mi agenda',
+                      style: textTheme.titleMedium?.copyWith(
+                        fontWeight: FontWeight.w800,
+                        color: GoogleColors.ink(GoogleColors.yellow),
+                      ),
+                    ),
+                  ),
+                  if (ids.isNotEmpty)
+                    Text(
